+# TLS certificate verification in development builds
+
+The project's most recent recorded position is that TLS certificate verification is enabled on all builds, development builds included. This comes from a user statement in an earlier session ("verification on all builds"), not from a formally recorded decision or a commit, so it is unconfirmed and should be re-checked with the project owner before anything relies on it. Nothing further is recorded, such as an exemption mechanism or a build-flag name. Separately, plain HTTP for internal hosts was noted in a later session, but no TLS verification setting is recorded for those hosts.
